{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2019-10-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE CHANGES EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 27, 2019', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 7, 2019, JOHNSON & JOHNSON ANNOUNCED THAT RONALD A. KAPUSTA, CONTROLLER AND CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER, HAS ELECTED TO RETIRE, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 27, 2019. ROBERT J. DECKER, JR. HAS BEEN APPOINTED CONTROLLER AND CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER OF THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 27, 2019.'}